- **Iterative DFS** (`KosarajuStronglyConnectedComponents`) — `collectFinishOrder` now uses an explicit `int[]` call-stack tracking per-node neighbor progress; `collectComponent` uses a plain work-stack with visited-on-push. Both methods are safe for arbitrarily large graphs.
